### 1. Naya Short URL Banane Ke Liye (POST Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/url/shorten
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "original_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ"
}

### 2. Redirect Test Karne Ke Liye (GET Request)
# Niche wale URL mein "XYZ123" ko apne generated short_id se replace karein
GET http://localhost:8080/XYZ123